  "title": "Captain's Log — Lupopedia Headers & Filesystem Navigation",
  "summary": "Architecture grounding: Lupopedia headers are the truth of the filesystem. Headers tell file location, schema, PRD cluster, artifact type, routing context, summary, canonical path. Navigation by headers = navigation by filesystem directories.",
